{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second Saga is an adventure RPG where you can level up, raise your stats, learn from an extensive skill tree, and make important decisions while traversing a large, expansive, and rich stylized 2D world. Find valuable loot or perform life skills like mining, smithing, and ranching in order to make your adventure easier. Defeat a huge cast of foes and save Crestelia Island from the unknown evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will allow you to explore the beginning area of Crestelia Island, as well as snippets of the various regions of the game. There are two bosses to conquer, along with player housing, pets and mounts, monster card collection, fishing, and crafting.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818110?t=1757300887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818110/917fba85d500d4d31db786731a295b14e0ce3d47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757300887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818110/c153e57de8d76a22c9a84bc5a5a233fd726f393b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757300887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818110/c153e57de8d76a22c9a84bc5a5a233fd726f393b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757300887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second Saga is an adventure RPG where you can level up, raise your stats, learn from an extensive skill tree, and make important decisions while traversing a large, expansive, and rich stylized 2D world. Find valuable loot or perform life skills like mining, smithing, and ranching in order to make your adventure easier. Defeat a huge cast of foes and save Crestelia Island from the unknown evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will allow you to explore the beginning area of Crestelia Island, as well as snippets of the various regions of the game. There are two bosses to conquer, along with player housing, pets and mounts, monster card collection, fishing, and crafting.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Fire Bird Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1972940","name":"Second Saga"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818110/c5966090067173b833f90bc376022a2e3a960ea0/header.jpg?t=1757300887","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 (Haswell) or Apple Silicon (M1, M2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194330,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194330/movie480.mp4?t=1757283837","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194330/movie_max.mp4?t=1757283837"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer 01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194330/c70d0cc6ee70031435758f963aac5bff4473f0cd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757283837","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194330/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757283837","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194330/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757283837"}}],"name":"Se